SUMMARY:Canning demonstration with Celeste Longacre
LOCATION:Heberton Hall\, Heberton Hall Kitchen
URL:https://keenenh.libcal.com/event/17162560
CATEGORIES:kids\,Keene Public Library
DESCRIPTION:Come and join Celeste Longacre for a hands-on demonstration of
  canning. We will take some onions\, tomatoes\, basil\, thyme\, garlic and
  oregano and whip up a delightful mix that we will then preserve in order 
 to save it for the future. I refer to these jars in my pantry as "summer i
 n a jar." Everyone will get a jar to take home.\n\nSpace is limited and re
 gistration is required.\n\nQuestions or more information. Please contact A
 my Kraemer akraemer@keenenh.gov\nSource: Keene Public Library
END:VEVENT
