SUMMARY:Kids Comic Club
LOCATION:Kay Fox Room
URL:https://keenenh.libcal.com/event/17442873
CATEGORIES:kids\,Keene Public Library
DESCRIPTION:For comic fans ages 8-12! We'll meet once a month to create to
 gether\, discuss great graphic novels\, and watch interviews and tutorials
  from our favorite artists. All skill levels are welcome\, and materials w
 ill be provided! Meetings will be held on the second Friday of each month.
 \n\nRegistration is appreciated. Questions or Concerns call the library 60
 3.352.0157.\nSource: Keene Public Library
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ad2c72e9e739edd5@kidcal
DTSTAMP:20260903T145711Z
DTSTART:20260912T150000Z
DTEND:20260912T163000Z
SUMMARY:PokéParty: 30th Anniversary Pokémon Celebration
LOCATION:Heberton Hall\, Heberton Hall Kitchen
URL:https://keenenh.libcal.com/event/17249916
CATEGORIES:kids\,Keene Public Library
DESCRIPTION:Pokémon fans ages 8 - 18 are invited to come celebrate the 30
 th anniversary of our favorite multi-media franchise\, from trading cards 
 to the cartoon to the video games. Bring some cards to trade\, decks to ba
 ttle\, and your creativity for some Pokémon-themed crafts! No cards? No p
 roblem! We'll have library-made booster packs (for free!) while supplies l
 asts\, as well as pre-made decks so everyone can try their hand at a battl
 e. \n\nWe encourage you to wear your Pokémon best\, whether that's a Pika
 chu onesie\, an awesome Charizard t-shirt\, or your Pokémon trainer outfi
 t!\n\nRegistration is appreciated :)\nSource: Keene Public Library
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:69c1bbe0602884ab@kidcal
DTSTAMP:20260903T145711Z
DTSTART:20260914T140000Z
DTEND:20260914T160000Z
SUMMARY:Community Resources: Childcare Aware of NH
LOCATION:Circulation Lobby
URL:https://keenenh.libcal.com/event/17094631
CATEGORIES:kids\,Keene Public Library
DESCRIPTION:Every second Monday of the month Child Care Aware of New Hamps
 hire will be in the circulation lobby to connect families with resources. 
 Child Care Aware® of New Hampshire seeks to improve the quality and acces
 sibility of child care for families and providers alike. \n\nThrough Child
  Care Aware® of New Hampshire\, Southern New Hampshire Services provides 
 Child Care Resource & Referral (CCR&R) services to educate and support fam
 ilies\, providers and the community regarding child care needs. We help ad
 minister and maintain a free and confidential referral database of child c
 are providers to connect families in need with available and qualified chi
 ld care.\nSource: Keene Public Library
END:VEVENT
