DTSTART:20260916T213000Z
DTEND:20260916T233000Z
SUMMARY:Learn to Laser Engrave at the Kingsbury Makerspace - Workshop
LOCATION:Kingsbury Makerspace
URL:https://keenenh.libcal.com/event/17237139
CATEGORIES:kids\,Keene Public Library
DESCRIPTION:Learn what you can make with our Laser Engraver! Discover what
  materials can be used with our laser engraver such as acrylics\, wood\, l
 eather and more. This workshop will provide you with all the information y
 ou need to start laser engraving\, and walk you through a hands-on activit
 y to laser engrave a custom graphic onto your own coaster or bookmark. All
  materials are provided. \n\nTo participate in this workshop you must comp
 lete the online tutorial: Introduction to the Makerspace and the Epilog La
 ser Engraver Certification Tutorial.  Both tutorials can be found here: ht
 tps://my.nicheacademy.com/makerspacetutorials\n\nPlease complete both of t
 hese tutorials by Tuesday September 8th. If you have trouble accessing the
  tutorials or have questions please call the makerspace directly (603 757-
 0621) and leave a message. We will respond within 48 hours. If you do not 
 complete the tutorials by this date your reservation will be cancelled and
  opened to a person on the wait-list.\n\nFor more information contact: A W
 elby awelby@keenenh.gov or Amy Kraemer akraemer@keenenh.gov\nSource: Keene
  Public Library
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:de65a36b06691ac2@kidcal
DTSTAMP:20260903T145711Z
DTSTART:20260917T220000Z
DTEND:20260917T233000Z
SUMMARY:Tech Talk - Tech Etiquette
LOCATION:Masiello Classroom
URL:https://keenenh.libcal.com/event/17185940
CATEGORIES:kids\,Keene Public Library
DESCRIPTION:This month's tech talk will be on the subject of tech etiquett
 e\, a Miss Manners for the digital age\, if you will.\n\nWe will discuss t
 hings like when to turn off speakerphone\, use of punctuation and implied 
 meaning in text messages\, and which method of communication is best suite
 d to which type of content\, among other subjects.\n\nRegistration is appr
 eciated.\nSource: Keene Public Library
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:b29e993289586969@kidcal
DTSTAMP:20260903T145711Z
DTSTART:20260919T223000Z
