SUMMARY:International Observe the Moon Night
LOCATION:Off-Site
URL:https://keenenh.libcal.com/event/17259934
CATEGORIES:kids\,Keene Public Library
DESCRIPTION:Join Keene Public Librarians and our friends from the Keene Am
 ateur Astronomers to take a look at the moon through a number of different
  types of telescopes.  Learn about the Keene Public Library's Library of T
 hings and how to check out our telescope. This is an all ages family frien
 dly event. Come curious and learn something amazing about our moon!\n\nPle
 ase register if you want to be advised of changes to the program due to we
 ather.\n\nWe will meet in the Ashuelot Park parking lot at 5:30.\nSource: 
 Keene Public Library
END:VEVENT
