BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:8e2f92d8ff2a78be@kidcal
DTSTAMP:20260903T145711Z
DTSTART:20261007T213000Z
DTEND:20261007T233000Z
SUMMARY:Learn to Laser Engrave at the Kingsbury Makerspace - Workshop
LOCATION:Kingsbury Makerspace
URL:https://keenenh.libcal.com/event/17563928
CATEGORIES:kids\,Keene Public Library
DESCRIPTION:Learn what you can make with our Laser Engraver! Discover what
  materials can be used with our laser engraver such as acrylics\, wood\, l
 eather and more. This workshop will provide you with all the information y
 ou need to start laser engraving\, and walk you through a hands-on activit
 y to laser engrave a custom graphic onto your own coaster or bookmark. All
  materials are provided. \n\nTo participate in this workshop you must comp
 lete the online tutorial: Introduction to the Makerspace and the Epilog La
 ser Engraver Certification Tutorial.  Both tutorials can be found here: ht
 tps://my.nicheacademy.com/makerspacetutorials\n\nPlease complete both of t
 hese tutorials by Thursday October 1st. If you have trouble accessing the 
 tutorials or have questions please call the makerspace directly (603 757-0
 621) and leave a message. We will respond within 48 hours. If you do not c
 omplete the tutorials by this date your reservation will be cancelled and 
 opened to a person on the wait-list. \n\nIf you have already taken this wo
 rkshop please do not sign up again to allow new makers to learn the tools.
 \n\nFor more information contact: A Welby awelby@keenenh.gov or Amy Kraeme
 r akraemer@keenenh.gov\nSource: Keene Public Library
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
