DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260912T103000
SUMMARY:Putney Plant Adventures with Rich Grumbine! **AT FOREST FOR LEARNI
 NG**
URL:https://putneylibrary.org/event/putney-plant-adventures-with-rich-grum
 bine-at-forest-for-learning/
CATEGORIES:kids\,Putney Public Library
DESCRIPTION:Putney Plant Adventures with Rich Grumbine!\nSaturday\, Septem
 ber 12\, 9am\nLocation: Meet at the Forest for Learning Kiosk (Next to the
  Town\nSwimming Pool\, 172 Westminster Rd\, Putney\, VT 05346)\nJoin Rich 
 Grumbine for a plant amble on the Forest for Learning\nlandscape.  We will
  focus our attention and discussion on the field\nand forest herbaceous pl
 ants of September\, and the common trees and shrubs we encounter along the
  way.   Plan to be out for 75 – 90\nminutes.  Dress for the weather and 
 tick bite prevention.\nSource: Putney Public Library
END:VEVENT
