SUMMARY:Music & Movement
URL:https://putneylibrary.org/event/music-movement-38/
CATEGORIES:kids\,Putney Public Library
DESCRIPTION:Join Stu (and Rowan) for a fun\, playful\, and participatory s
 ong circle for children ages 0–5!\nIn this interactive class\, children 
 and their caregivers will be invited to sing\, play musical games\, explor
 e percussion instruments\, and move their bodies along with uplifting song
 s from folk traditions around the world—all accompanied by guitar\, ukul
 ele\, and violin.\nSource: Putney Public Library
END:VEVENT
