SUMMARY:Mending Bee
URL:https://putneylibrary.org/event/mending-bee-26/2026-09-20/
CATEGORIES:kids\,Putney Public Library
DESCRIPTION:Do you have a pile of nice wool socks with holes\, favorite je
 ans that would be perfect if not for a rip in the knee\, or sweaters with 
 moth holes?\nBring your ailing fabric items to the Putney Public Library o
 nce a month on Sundays 1-4pm to work on them in the company of others. Adv
 ice and support are always available\, but you’ll be the mender of your 
 own items.\nSewing machines and darning tools are available to use during 
 the Bee.\nSource: Putney Public Library
END:VEVENT
